# Byte-determinism is a load-bearing property of this repo (trust bundles must
# emit and re-derive identically on every platform, spec 0137). Force LF on all
# text files so a checkout is byte-identical everywhere — GitHub's Windows
# runners default to autocrlf=true, which would otherwise rewrite line endings
# and break byte-pinned docs and fixtures.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary/parquet-ish assets are never touched (none tracked today; explicit for
# future-proofing).
*.parquet binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
